===Speak with Pela in the museum{{subst:void|<!--201190301-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=History and Culture Museum|You finished one phase of the museum's operation.<br />You seem to see Pela again in the exhibit hall. Go and say hello to her, and see if there has been any progress regarding the artifact thefts.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Pela)
:'''Pela:''' (Trailblazer), good to see you again! I've heard from Miss Eris that under your superb management, the museum is on the verge of regaining the thriving crowds of its heyday.
:'''Pela:''' If the momentum continues, and if the History-Culture Hall can reopen on schedule... the museum's complete revival is surely just around the corner!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What went missing this time?
::'''Pela:''' ...So you guessed it already.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Good thing you have me around.
::'''Pela:''' ...Ahem. Yes, indeed.
:'''Pela:''' ...I'm afraid there's been another theft. Like the previous cases, a valuable item was stolen from our exhibit &mdash; this time in the History-Culture Hall. The item in question has a connection to you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Was it a photo of me? I can always take a new one for you.
::'''Pela:''' No. As you just pointed out, that kind of thing is easily replaced.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Was it my weapon? Here &mdash; I'll give it to you right now.
::'''Pela:''' Uh, that won't be necessary &mdash; we've already made a high-quality replica.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So what is it?
::'''Pela:''' Hehe, have I piqued your curiosity?
:'''Pela:''' It'll be easier to explain once we're actually in the History-Culture Hall. Why don't I take you there now?
:'''Pela:''' With an exhibit like this, all Belobogians will know your story, (Trailblazer).
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Head to the History and Culture Exhibit{{subst:void|<!--201190302-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=History and Culture Museum|update|Pela was satisfied with the results you achieved while operating the museum.<br />She wants to open up the History Exhibit next, but a key exhibit in this area was stolen. Go and see what the situation is.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Pela:''' You can probably guess from the name that the History-Culture Hall houses artifacts, replicas, and documents that are of great historical significance to Belobog.
:'''Pela:''' Every passing day, we Belobogians must continue to endure the city's harsh environment. The trials and experiences of our ancestors serve as a reminder that the path of survival belongs to every generation of our people.
:'''Pela:''' Every child in Belobog should visit this exhibit at least once... No, once isn't nearly enough.

