:'''Pela:''' This projector is a limited-edition version custom-made for the museum &mdash; the only one of its kind in the whole of Belobog. It can produce images with a resolution of up to...
:'''Pela:''' ...Oh, sorry, I'm doing my tour guide thing again. I'm sure someone as well-traveled as yourself has seen much fancier equipment than this.
