===Head to Qlipoth Fort and speak with Bronya{{subst:void|<!--201190303-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Qlipoth Fort|update|The microfilm used to display projections was stolen. Without this film, the History Exhibit cannot open to the public.<br />The thefts have already reached Bronya's ears. Go to Qlipoth Fort and speak with her regarding how to continue the investigation.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Bronya:''' (Trailblazer), Pela, welcome.
:'''Bronya:''' If I'm not mistaken, the two of you just rushed over here from the History and Culture Museum? I appreciate your coming here on such short notice.
:'''Bronya:''' I should have gotten involved earlier, but I was tied up with other responsibilities. My apologies for letting you take on the investigation without proper support.
:'''Pela:''' Lady Bronya, we never saw it like that...
:'''Bronya:''' ...Hehe, there's no one else here, Pela &mdash; no need for such formality.
:'''Pela:''' ...Okay, Miss Bronya.
:'''Bronya:''' (Trailblazer), I heard that you helped recover a number of valuable items for the museum, and that you've been running the museum as a part-time manager &mdash; do you have any insights into this serial theft case?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm just taking it one step at a time. There doesn't seem to be much headway.
::'''Bronya:''' Is that so? I see.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It feels like we've gotten very lucky.
::'''Bronya:''' Or maybe it's just the fruit of your efforts?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Whoever's behind this is one Smooth Criminal for sure.
::'''Bronya:''' Well, on that point, we can agree.
:'''Bronya:''' In any case, this fiasco has been going on right under our noses for too long. Regardless of how cunning and talented the culprit may be, we must draw them out and demonstrate the resolve of the Architects.
:'''Bronya:''' Pela, (Trailblazer) &mdash; I will issue an immediate directive to mobilize all on-duty Silvermane Guards in the city to conduct a door-to-door investigation.
:'''Bronya:''' You're familiar with many of the locals in the Administrative District, right? If possible, I'd like you to head to the city center and see if they have any clues to offer us.
:'''Pela:''' Understood! We'll head there at once, Miss Bronya.
:'''Pela:''' (Trailblazer), guess you're stuck with me again for this assignment. Let's meet up at Fountain Plaza.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

